      "title": "Lahman Baseball Ontology",
      "description": "The classes and predicates this package's RML mappings project the Lahman database's relations onto. Eleven classes — the register of people, the franchise and the team-season it splits into, the stint that batting/pitching/fielding share, and the association entities for awards, ballots, college attendance and ballpark residency.",
